    {
      "q": "How much does Elbitamerica make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Elbitamerica has $358M in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Elbitamerica received 178 awards in FY2026 to date, with an average award size of $2M, and obligations are up 359.5% year over year. Historical obligations include $115M in FY21, $119M in FY22, $96.8M in FY23, $137M in FY24, and $77.9M in FY25."
